SilphCo_4F_Text_HaulBeltOffer:
	.string "This is it. I'm done working here.\p"
	.string "When those Rocket thugs stormed in,\n"
	.string "I thought that was the end of me.\p"
	.string "Hauling crates in a place like this,\n"
	.string "for what? I've got my own dreams.\p"
	.string "Here, you take this. I won't be\n"
	.string "lugging heavy loads anymore.$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_HaulBeltFarewell:
	.string "With that belt on, you can move\n"
	.string "heavy things with ease.\p"
	.string "Crates, furniture, even boulders!\n"
	.string "It saved my back for years.\p"
    .string "Me? Soon I'll walk out that door and\n"
	.string "chase something bigger. Take care!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_HaulBeltPostGift:
	.string "Still here? Not me, not for long.\p"
	.string "The world's a lot bigger than this\n"
	.string "office. Go see it for yourself.$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_TeamRocketIsGone::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "Team Rocket is gone?$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Team Rocket has taken control\n"
    .string "of Silph Co.!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Arrgh!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "Fwahahaha!\n"
    .string "My Boss has been after this place!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_RodneyIntro::
    .string "My Pokémon is my loyal servant.$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_RodneyDefeat::
    .string "Darn!\n"
    .string "You weak Pokémon!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_RodneyPostBattle::
    .string "The doors are electronically\n"
    .string "locked.\p"
    .string "It takes a Card Key to open the\n"
    .string "doors here.$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "Intruder spotted!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Who are you?$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "I better tell the Boss on 11F!$"

SilphCo_4F_Text_FloorSign::
